{"id":"u-9fdb6264-2d3f-479a-befc-5439985e708c","src":"community","title":"Bench focus","author":"Roland Baker","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/zzIT2H-bench-focus-1","desc":"Simple concurrent bench strength and size template with some leg and back work.  The pressing days are organized as follows: Base Set/Heavy Rep Set/Down Set/Pump. \nBase:\nThis is weight that you are looking to get up to 9-10 reps over the next few weeks; when you start, this weight should be a very hard 6-7 rep weight to start.\n Heavy:\nAdd 45+ lbs  for bench and 20lbs for strict press to the base set weight going for 1-2 reps in the first week. We will get this to 3-4 later.\nDown set:\nRemove the 45lbs from base  bench weight and 20lbs from strict press hit 10+ reps on this.\nPump:\nStrip another 45lbs off and amrap\n After reaching 10 reps on your base set increase the weight by 10lbs for all sets each session. Once you stall in progression take an off week where no volume is performed","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":3,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T14:46:23.429Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9},{"lo":1,"hi":5,"rpe":9},{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8},{"lo":15,"hi":30,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Wide Grip Pull-Up","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Row","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Shrug (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":20,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":7,"rpe":9},{"lo":1,"hi":5,"rpe":8.5},{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7},{"lo":15,"hi":30,"rpe":7}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Close Grip)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":6},{"r":5